	"FriendlyName": "3DHeat Level Exporter",
	"Description": "Exports a decimated, world-space copy of a level as a single .glb for the 3DHeat telemetry viewer. Editor only; no C++ module, so it needs no compilation and drops into any UE 5.x project.",
